  ],
  "notes": "A formal verb meaning to devise and carry out a plan. Almost always pairs with words for measures or steps. The variant {講|こう}ずる is identical in meaning and slightly more literary.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {対策|たいさく}を{講|こう}じる: to take countermeasures\n- {措置|そち}を{講|こう}じる: to take a measure\n- {手|て}を{講|こう}じる: to take a step / do something about it",
